  "reference": "Abaroma 3",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuYahudi ashilila shiina abandi? Kata eshishebo shikaasila shiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbula, namakhuwa amanji; olwambeli, mbu baheebwa obulindi bwamasungo kaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhaba karie, abandi khubo nibaba nibabula obwisiikwa? Obutambi bwabwe bwobwisiikwa bunyala okhwira obwisiikwa bwaNyasaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'A, nahatuutu ta; mbula Nyasaye amanyishe nali owatoto, ne buli mundu yesi omubeeyi; shinga olwa kahandiikwa, kari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obumayaanu bweefwe nibuba nibulolosia obulunjishi bwaNyasaye, khuboole khurie? Nyasaye ouchilanga imongol niyikhukwila nomumayaanu noho? (Emboola shinga omundu namundu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako ta; nikali kario, Nyasaye yakhanyala arie okhuyaasia eshialo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne obubeeyi bwanje nibuba nibuchila obwatoto bwaNyasaye nibulolekha obunji bwabwo naye waheebwamwo oluyali, mbushiina isie nishiyaasibwa shinga omwonooni? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mbushiina nikhuraboola, shinga olwa khuchiikhungwa, abandi nibaboola mbu toto mwene, nilwo olwa khusunganga, mbu Khukhole obumayaanu, obulayi mana burulemwo? Nabeenabo, eshiina shibafwiliile habwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abulaho omulunjishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho karie? Khubashila bo neshindu noho? 'A, tawe; okhuba khumalile okhubeenjilila abaYahudi nabaYunani bombi, mbu bosi bali abasumba bobwonooni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shinga olwa kahandiikwa, mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khumanyile mbu aka amalako kabooIanga, kababoolelanga abo abali abasumba bamalako; mbu buli munwa kusibwe, khandi mbu eshialo shiosi shileerwe hasi wobuyaasii bwaNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba imbeliwe omundu yesi shialabasilibwakhwo obulunjishi khulwa ebikhole biamalako ta; shichila amalako kakhumanyinjia obwonooni shinga olwa buli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulunjishi obunyooleshela mukhusuubila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano buliho obulunjishi bwaNyasaye obulolosiibwe harali amalako tawe; amalako nende abanabii nibirumbula obuloli khubwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibwo obulunjishi bwaNyasaye obunyoolekhanga munjila yokhusuubilila Yesu Kristo, khubeenabo bosi abamusuubilila shichila bubulaho obwahulwi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba bosi bayoonoona, nibaleema okhuula khuluyali lwaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babasilibwakhwo obulunjishi butswa khulwa obukoosiabwe, khunjila yobununulwi obunyoolekha muKristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yamuruma omwenoyo mbu abe eshitiso khulwa amabangake, munjila yobusuubili; mbu alolosie ario obulunjishibwe khulwa okhumaayia ebionoono ebiakholwa khale, mubwisimilisi bwaNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhulolosia obulunjishibwe khunduukho yino; mbu omwene abe omulunjishi, khandi abe ye oumubasiliakhwo obulunjishi omundu yesi oumusuubilila Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano okhwitsiala khuli heena? Khwikaliilwa elala. Ne khulwa lilako elieimbia shiina? Eliebikhole noho? Tawe; habula khulwa lilako liobusuubili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako khuluutsi mbu omundu abasilibwakhwo obulunjishi khulwa obusuubili aharali ebikhole biamalako ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nohomba Nyasaye niNyasaye wabaYahudi bonyene? Ye shiali Nyasaye wAbamahanga bosi? Toto mwene, nowAbamahanga bosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye naba nali mulala; ne alababasiliakhwo abeshishebo obulunjishi khulwa obusuubili, khandi abasinde bosi bario munjila yobusuubili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khwiranga amalako khulwa obusuubili noho? 'A nahatuutu ta. Nebutswa khutinyinjia amalako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.3.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
